        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-12-16T19:45:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can see that interpretation, JayMann, and I wouldn’t really be too upset if thats how it was, but my thought is that one hero target cant both have the highest hp and the lowest hp at the same time unless it is the only hero target in play.</p>",
