        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/e47c2d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-12-16T22:21:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What if there are two heroes, each one hit point apart (A 26, B 25).  Say a villain’s power does 2 damage to highest hp hero and 3 to second highest…once the first damage happens to A, wouldn’t he then become the second higest hps, so he takes the second damage as well?   :o</p>\n<p>…No.  That’s just silly.  Still, it came to mind.  ;D</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:58:35.777Z",
